  {
   "caption": "Add the numbers of the failing circles: 2 + 4 = 6. The only position inside circles 2 and 4 but outside circle 1 is 6, so flip it back. Syndrome 6, corrected word 0110011.",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "b6",
     "set": {
      "label": "1",
      "tone": "success",
      "fill": "success"
     }
    },
